{"labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn9le03ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<p>It's time for me to start looking for a new job. I've decided that I'm going to\npost about my journey on this blog. <p>Finding a job can sometimes be a lengthy process. I know  the job search itself will take a fair investment of both time and energy.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn9le03ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<p>First, I will need to identify and analyze my skills and interests. I'm going to consider what it is that I want to do and how well my particular skills and interests match the job expectations. I'm going to see what jobs are out there. I'll have to determine if I need any additional skill sets or experience to help me get the job I want.<p>I'm going to create a master r\u00e9sum\u00e9. That way, I can change it for each specific\njob. I'll have to work on writing cover letters as well. Today, I'm reviewing my\nsocial media accounts to ensure the image prospective employers see of me online is representative of the way I want to be seen.", "id": 2, "time": "16000", "image": "engenn9le03ob02re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<p>I'm debating on whether or not I'll utilize my network. Many employers and job\nseekers agree that this is the best way to find a good job. I have read that many times employers fill positions with candidates their contacts have forwarded to them.<p>Finally, I'll start researching the job types that suit both my interests and the skills that I have. I'm going to start by looking within Boston. I want to\nstay in the city. I'm thinking about attending a job fair. I wonder if there are\nany coming up.", "id": 3, "time": "55500", "image": "engenn9le03ob02re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le03ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le03ob02re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs and career plans.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about the job search process.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss future plans.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What are the steps you take to find a job?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Which step do you think is the most important?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "What are the steps to follow?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Kristi posts in her job diary. Does she think her skills <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">align</span> with the <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_1\">expectations</span> of the job?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content