or the interlocutor.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Future with \u201cWill\u201d", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " One of the most common ways of talking about the<span class=\"strong\"> future </span>in English is by using the auxiliary verb \u201c<span class=\"italic\">will</span>\u201d. Here's more on how to form and talk about the future with \u201c<span class=\"italic\">will</span>\u201d.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ul><li>You use \u201cwill\u201d to talk about decisions made at the time of speaking.<br><span class=\"italic\">I will make use of my network.</span><br></li><li>You use \u201cwill\u201d to talk about facts or events in the future.  <br><span class=\"italic\">I will start researching jobs.</span> <br></li><li>You use \u201cwill\u201d to make predictions based on personal opinions. <br><span class=\"italic\"> It will take a reasonable investment of time and energy.</span></ul><br><br>Here's how to form the future with \u201cwill\u201d", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Affirmative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject + will/'ll\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"go through all the steps.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Negative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject + will not /won't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"go through all the steps.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Interrogative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Will + subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"go through all the steps?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "They'll walk us through all the steps.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We won't go through all the steps.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Will you go through all the steps with me?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking about the Future", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Using \u201cwill\u201d is one way to talk about the future. There are two other ways you can talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you talk about intentions, you use<span class=\"italic\"> be going to.</span><br>When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the<span class=\"strong\"> Present Continuous</span> tense.<br>Many people use<span class=\"italic\"> be going to</span> in place of the</span class=\"strong\"> Present Continuous </span>tense. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" The Modal <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Will\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" talk about things that are not decided; make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future; make predictions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">will </span>look for a new job.</span><br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">I think it <span class=\\\"strong\\\">will </span>take a lot of time and energy.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Be going to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"talk about intentions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">I'm going to </span>start a blog about my journey.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">I'm reviewing </span>my account this afternoon.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "job search ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the act of looking for employment  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I know  the job search will take time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about getting a job.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "investment ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something that you do because it will be useful later ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The search itself will take a fair investment of both time and energy.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "skills and interests ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " things you do well and enjoy doing because you have learned and practiced them ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I will need to identify and analyze my skills and interests.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "master r\u00e9sum\u00e9", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a document which includes your education and your previous jobs ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I'm going to create a master r\u00e9sum\u00e9.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cover letter ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a letter that you send with documents that give information about its contents ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll have to work on writing cover letters as well. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "representative", "type": "name"}, {"content": "describes how you typically are", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Ensure the image prospective employers see of you online is representative of the way you want to be seen.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to utilize ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to use something for a particular purpose  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I can \ufeffutilize social media to find a job. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "network ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a group of people that are connected", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "  Example:  I can also \ufeffutilize my network to find a job. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "job fair ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an event where people go to get information about different kinds of jobs ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm thinking about attending a job fair.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02aud10", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write down all the steps of the job search process. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "After you have done that, write down your plans on how you will carry out each step of the process. Write down the things you have completed and things you will need to do to complete that step.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read through your plan. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share and compare your plan with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write about the job search process.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about my future plans related to the job search.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about the job search process and my future plans with my partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}